'''Pacify''' is a [[hex]] [[curse]] skill.

This skill is granted by {{il|The Queller of Minds}}, and by [[Bog Shaman]]'s {{psl|id=AscendancyCustomNecromancer8}}.

==Mechanics==

Pacify targets enemies in an area, having no effect initially but causes affected enemies to deal no [[damage]] after 60% of the curse's duration has expired. Pacify does not prevent on-hit effects, and has no effect on mechanics that instantly [[kill]] the player or arena hazards like the [[Drowning]] orbs in [[Absence of Symmetry and Harmony]], or [[Sirus]]' Deatomization Storm. Casting Pacify on a target already affected by Pacify will reset the curse's duration.

Increasing curse [[duration]] will lengthen the period of damage nullification, but also increases the time required to reach that effect; conversely, reducing curse duration will make the effect apply faster but have a smaller window of nullification. Pacify does not directly scale with curse effect, but 100% reduced curse effect will prevent the damage nullification.

